From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|muna|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|munanan|lang=gem-pro}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-preterite|man|mundi|munað}}

# {{context|with accusative}} to [[remember]]
#: ''Ég '''man''' ekki hvað hann heitir.''
#:: I can't '''remember''' what his name is.
